window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I'm like a snake shedding its skin.</b></p> <p>Shedding my old life. All the pain and torment are in the past while I figure out who I am.</p> <p>I fled from one monster only to find three more.</p> <p>What do a professional MMA fighter, a man who struggles to let anyone in, and our coach have in common?</p> <p>Me.</p> <p>They help me train. Help me find myself, my strength, my solace through MMA training and through my now uncaged desires.</p> <p>When the nightmares that plague my sleep come calling, will the strength I've found be enough?</p> <p>Uncaged Desires <i>is an MMA romance by Madi Danielle. Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
